  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Covid19 - Urgent Health Support Program Iraq - Phase I</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Covid19 - Urgent Health Support Program Iraq - Phase I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">Errichtung von f&#xfc;nf funktionst&#xfc;chtigen und ausgestatteten Behelfskrankenh&#xe4;usern an f&#xfc;nf verschiedenen Standorten landesweit und gegebenenfalls weitere Ma&#xdf;nahmen zur Unterst&#xfc;tzung der irakischen Gesundheitsbeh&#xf6;rden bei der Behandlung von Covid-19-PatientInnen im Irak.Aktuelle Standorte: Al-Kark, Mosul, Al-Rasufa, Al-Sulaimaniyah, Basra.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of five functioning and equipped makeshift hospitals in five different locations nationwide and, if necessary, further measures to support the Iraqi health authorities in the treatment of COVID-19 patients in Iraq.Current locations: Al-Kark, Mosul, Al-Rasufa, Al-Sulaimanya, Basra.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="DE">The Iraqi health system is supported by providing medical ressources to treat Covid19 patients during the epidemic and additional health ressources are provided after de-cline of infection rate</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Iraqi health system is supported by providing medical ressources to treat Covid19 patients during the epidemic and additional health ressources are provided after de-cline of infection rate</narrative>
  </description>
